<title>JAPAN: Denkyosha - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Denkyosha - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.71		vs	   14.21</p>
<p> Operating	  168    million    vs	  122    million</p>
<p> Current	    533    million    vs	  490    million</p>
<p> Net		  285    million    vs	  228    million</p>
<p> EPS		   20.93 yen	  vs	   16.71 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Denkyosha Co Ltd is a trading company specialising in consumer electronics.</p>
